	(text "AUX ELECTRODES (2026-09-04): E5/E6 = two Ø3 mm gold pads on the sensor face, differential AIN4/AIN5 (same nets as the EXP_A4/EXP_A5 expansion pads). \nExperiment: electroplate iridium oxide on E5 = planar pH-change electrode, E6 = bare gold pseudo-reference. Reads pH CHANGE only. Unused = two harmless gold dots.\n TP21/TP22 = bootloader BUTTON_DFU / BUTTON_FRESET pads, restored (tweezer-to-GND forces DFU before the dip)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
